<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 34.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 34.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 34.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (Central Bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rate unchanged and bids accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY    BID     AMOUNT   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks     6.5	6.5     8.50 pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks    15	 15	 9.00</p>
<p>    5  years     3	  3	10.00</p>
<p>    15 years    10	 10	10.50</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	34.5	34.5</p>
<p>($1= 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
